item.description:
&lt;p data-vmark="b860"&gt;IT之家 10 月 20 日消息，据路透社报道，两位知情人士称，OpenAI 正争分夺秒地争取投资者承诺，力求在竞争对手 Anthropic 预计于 11 月中旬上市之前完成融资。此次融资节奏异常迅速，若顺利完成，&lt;strong&gt;这家 ChatGPT 开发商的估值可能超过 1.4 万亿美元&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class="exch-money-value "&gt;（IT之家注：现汇率约合 9.37 万亿元人民币）&lt;/span&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;
[4기준 점수] impact=3.8 freshness=5.0 depth=3.0 buzz=1.5
출처: cn_itzhi (CN)

&lt;p&gt;OpenAI CEO Sam Altman last week told employees about three proposals the industry has discussed for how to safely develop AI, a stark framing that comes just as the Trump administration sets up its first system for policing “superintelligence” developers like OpenAI.&lt;
[4기준 점수] impact=4.5 freshness=5.0 depth=3.0 buzz=1.5
출처: theinformation (US)
